{"3":[{"k":"p","t":"\u201cFRONT LINE\u201d UPRIGHT"},{"k":"li","t":"1. GAME SET-UP"},{"k":"p","t":"A. INTRODUCTION \u201cFRONT LINE\u2019\u2019\u2122 upright is Taito America Corporation\u2019s newest action war game. Traveling through enemy territory the player must accomplish the ultimate mission or meet violent end: capture the enemy fort and win total victory. The journey begins slowly with the player armed with a gun (special \u201cGun Control\u2019) and hand grenades. Quickly he becomes a target for enemy soldiers who also have guns and grenades. Moving faster, he races past trees that hide the enemy who now unleash an ambush barrage of bullets and bombs. Even the ground he races over has been booby-trapped with land mines. lf the player successfully makes it through this deadly obstacle course, he meets an even greater challenge . . . the enemy is attacking with tanks! His gun now useless, the player can stand and fight with grenades or leap into his own tank (special \u2018Tank\u2019 button) and counter attack. The battle rages on all fronts as the player fights for his life, racing for cover behind brick walls while outrunning grenades thrown by soldiers in fox holes. It\u2019s all-out war when the player jumps from his tank into a larger \u2018one with greater firepower. Now comes the final test of victory as the enemy's fort looms in sight. The player must leap from the tank and run through a hail of bullets to throw one final grenade. The white flag heralds total victory!"},{"k":"p","t":"B. GAME INSPECTION TAITO AMERICA'S CORPORATION'S \u201cFRONT LINE\u201d\u2019\u2122 upright game is ready to play when received. However, careful inspection is necessary to insure your game is in perfect condition. Please verify the following before turning the game on."},{"k":"p","t":"Examine external parts for chips, dents, or broken parts. Open the service door and examine the following:"},{"k":"p","t":"Plug-in connectors to make sure they are firmly seated. Speaker Player Controls Printed Circuit Boards making sure there is no damage to the components. Check for loose foreign objects, especially metal objects which may cause electrical problems."},{"k":"li","t":"* Fuses, making sure they are firmly in the holders."},{"k":"li","t":"* Coin Mechanisms"},{"k":"p","t":"The Video Monitor is properly adjusted before shipping. If there are any adjustments necessary refer to our Video Monitor Manual (72-06035- 001)."},{"k":"p","t":"If problems occur or technical assistance is required, contact our Customer Service Department HOT LINE Toll Free 800-323-0666 (except Mlinois). Illinois phone 312 981-1000 X215."},{"k":"p","t":"POWER REQUIREMENTS TAITO AMERICA CORPORATION'S \u201cFRONT LINE\u201d\u2019\u2122 upright game is shipped ready for operation at 120VAC, 60Hz with a power consumption of approximately 250 Watts."},{"k":"note","t":"CAUTION"},{"k":"p","t":"For safe operation it is recommended the cabinet be grounded. This game is equipped with a three conductor power cable. The third conductor is the ground conductor and when the cable is plugged into an appropriate receptable, the game is grounded. The offset pin on the power cable\u2019s three-prong connector is the ground connection. LOCATION SPACE REQUIREMENTS"},{"k":"p","t":"Depth - 35\u201d (87.5cm) Width - 24\u201d (61cm) Height - 68\u201d (171cm) Weight - 300 Ibs. (Packaged Weight)"},{"k":"p","t":"C. GAME INSTALLATION The following precautions should be followed when installing the game."},{"k":"li","t":"* Avoid rough handling of the game, the picture tube is fragile. Install the game on a level surface. Avoid installing the game where it may receive excessive sunlight or heat, to prevent the game from rising internal temperature. Do not install in a damp or dusty location."},{"k":"li","t":"* For a short time after connecting the power to the game, the picture may be temporarily distorted."},{"k":"p","t":"D. DIP SWITCH AND VOLUME CONTROL SETTINGS"},{"k":"p","t":"DIP SWITCHES Taito America Corporation's \u2018\u2018Front Line\u2019 game provides the following option switches. See Figure 1. These option switches can be found on the Game board (99-AAO17808)."},{"k":"p","t":"Dip Switch A"},{"k":"tr","t":"SETTING   POSITION   1] 2)   3)4   7 [3 |"},{"k":"tr","t":"Points   10,000   | OFF} OFF"},{"k":"tr","t":"For Adding   20,000   | ON"},{"k":"tr","t":"one Soldier   30,000   | OFF"},{"k":"p","t":"Free Play Free Play No. of 3 Soldiers 5"},{"k":"p","t":"Normal |"},{"k":"p","t":"Ciara REERERE, [Goin Pay_| 1 Play [ on_| on ON {| ON }rea-2 Bae fore Font ow fo tor on Fon FHS [1 Goin - 3 Plays | ow | or [on | on | on | oFF [2 Goins- 1 Play [on [on [on [orF | on [ on | on | oFF |"},{"k":"tr","t":"Pune   Bas [Ore TON   Tow jum   oF Fon   [on"},{"k":"p","t":"[OFF | ON | OFF"}],"11":[{"k":"p","t":"TAITO"},{"k":"tr","t":"ITEM   \u2014_| PART NO.   DESCRIPTION   REFERENCE"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   61-00270-001 | Door Frame   15-8039"},{"k":"tr","t":"2   61-00271-001 | Door   15-8038"},{"k":"tr","t":"3   61-00272-001 | Hinge   i   30-9125"},{"k":"tr","t":"4   61-00273-001 | Taito Name Plate   15-8115"},{"k":"tr","t":"5   63-00124-001 | Coin Entry Slot   15-8074"},{"k":"tr","t":"6   63-00125-001 | Push Button Cover   15-8072"},{"k":"tr","t":"7   63-00126-001 | Push Button   15-8071"},{"k":"tr","t":"8   58-00007-001 | Compression Spring   30-7722"},{"k":"tr","t":"i)   63-00127-001 | Reject Lever   15-8084"},{"k":"tr","t":"10   61-00274-001 | Coin Chute   15-8075"},{"k":"tr","t":"i}   63-00128-001 | Coin Return Door   15-8083"},{"k":"tr","t":"12   61-00275-001 , Coin Box   15-8081"},{"k":"tr","t":"13   61-00276-001 , Guard   15-8092"},{"k":"tr","t":"14   63-00129-001 | Coil Bracket   15-8080"},{"k":"tr","t":"15   23-00003-001 | Coil Assortment   15-8091"},{"k":"tr","t":"16   63-00130-001 | Switch Cover   15-8043"},{"k":"tr","t":"17   .| 29-00036-001 | Slam Switch   15-1255"},{"k":"tr","t":"18   59-00055-001 | Plastic 85* Coin Acceptor   31-4014"},{"k":"tr","t":"19   